{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/LetalInvasion.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lethal Invasion is a 3D third-person survival and melee combat game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Lethal Invasion, survive hordes of enemies that will appear in each round. In early access, there will be one map; in each map, there will be portals where enemies from other realms will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can equip new weapons by purchasing them with points earned by eliminating enemies; additionally, you can upgrade them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy single-use skills and gear up as best as you can to survive all the rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/GAME_FEATURES.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/ENEMIES.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enemies in the only map available during early access will be able to perform various attacks and, most importantly, will be able to dodge your attacks. As more rounds pass, the difficulty will increase, and enemies will become harder to eliminate\u2014whether due to their health, their attacks, or how often they dodge your strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/ROUNDS.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each round, 5 portals will be created that will attract demons. Each portal will have a limit on the number of enemies it can summon. Once the enemy limit is eliminated, the portal will be destroyed. After all 5 portals are destroyed, players will advance to the next round, and 5 new portals will be created with new limits and possible difficulty upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/Captura_de_pantalla_2025-05-30_154755.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/UNLOCKING_NEW_AREAS.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new areas of the map by purchasing doors. Each door will have a protective shield; to remove the shield and gain access, you must earn the required points and use them to open the door and enter that area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/Captura_de_pantalla_2025-05-30_153421.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/POINTS.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can earn points by eliminating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, there is another currency\u2014LethalCoin. To obtain LethalCoins, you must exchange points for the currency.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/PLAYER_FEATURES.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge enemy attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform combo-based melee attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy new weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase single-use abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/PLAYER_ATTACKS_AND_COMBOS.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can execute individual or combined attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/WEAPON_PURCHASE_UNLOCK.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each weapon will be mounted on the walls, but it will have a protective shield that can only be removed using LethalCoin. To purchase the weapon, you must first eliminate the shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/Captura_de_pantalla_2025-05-30_153634.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/WEAPON_PURCHASE.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will be able to upgrade their equipment with a maximum of 2 weapons. You can purchase weapons using points and will have the opportunity to upgrade them to survive more rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/ABILITY_PURCHASE.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will be able to buy single-use skills with LethalCoin. There will be various skills that will greatly enhance the gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/WEAPON_UPGRADES.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can upgrade weapons using LethalCoin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The upgrade will increase the damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/LANGUAGES.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will be available in Spanish and English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/GAME_MODES.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online:</strong> You will be able to play online with your friends and other people, up to a maximum of 5 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Private matches:</strong> You will be able to play private matches alone or with your friends without the need for random players to join (coming soon).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tutorial:</strong> The tutorial will help any player learn how to play without issues. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730660?t=1751553962","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730660?t=1751553962","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/141a31c37dff230678b5a2fc66b7b75b0e079adb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751553962","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/141a31c37dff230678b5a2fc66b7b75b0e079adb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751553962","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/LetalInvasion.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lethal Invasion is a 3D third-person survival and melee combat game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Lethal Invasion, survive hordes of enemies that will appear in each round. In early access, there will be one map; in each map, there will be portals where enemies from other realms will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can equip new weapons by purchasing them with points earned by eliminating enemies; additionally, you can upgrade them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy single-use skills and gear up as best as you can to survive all the rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/GAME_FEATURES.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/ENEMIES.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enemies in the only map available during early access will be able to perform various attacks and, most importantly, will be able to dodge your attacks. As more rounds pass, the difficulty will increase, and enemies will become harder to eliminate\u2014whether due to their health, their attacks, or how often they dodge your strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/ROUNDS.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each round, 5 portals will be created that will attract demons. Each portal will have a limit on the number of enemies it can summon. Once the enemy limit is eliminated, the portal will be destroyed. After all 5 portals are destroyed, players will advance to the next round, and 5 new portals will be created with new limits and possible difficulty upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/Captura_de_pantalla_2025-05-30_154755.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/UNLOCKING_NEW_AREAS.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new areas of the map by purchasing doors. Each door will have a protective shield; to remove the shield and gain access, you must earn the required points and use them to open the door and enter that area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/Captura_de_pantalla_2025-05-30_153421.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/POINTS.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can earn points by eliminating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, there is another currency\u2014LethalCoin. To obtain LethalCoins, you must exchange points for the currency.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/PLAYER_FEATURES.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge enemy attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform combo-based melee attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy new weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase single-use abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/PLAYER_ATTACKS_AND_COMBOS.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can execute individual or combined attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/WEAPON_PURCHASE_UNLOCK.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each weapon will be mounted on the walls, but it will have a protective shield that can only be removed using LethalCoin. To purchase the weapon, you must first eliminate the shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/Captura_de_pantalla_2025-05-30_153634.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/WEAPON_PURCHASE.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will be able to upgrade their equipment with a maximum of 2 weapons. You can purchase weapons using points and will have the opportunity to upgrade them to survive more rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/ABILITY_PURCHASE.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will be able to buy single-use skills with LethalCoin. There will be various skills that will greatly enhance the gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/WEAPON_UPGRADES.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can upgrade weapons using LethalCoin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The upgrade will increase the damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/LANGUAGES.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will be available in Spanish and English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/GAME_MODES.png?t=1751553962\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online:</strong> You will be able to play online with your friends and other people, up to a maximum of 5 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Private matches:</strong> You will be able to play private matches alone or with your friends without the need for random players to join (coming soon).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tutorial:</strong> The tutorial will help any player learn how to play without issues. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Qokust"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/ef8dd532779c72cb2cd52bbe6546f69d4b3b046d/header.jpg?t=1751553962","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Lethal Invasion","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/ Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Dual Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/ Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Dual Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Qokust"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"1 Aug, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/867975a8d67ff23a6800fa18b457994bff3d8a0c/ss_867975a8d67ff23a6800fa18b457994bff3d8a0c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751553962","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/867975a8d67ff23a6800fa18b457994bff3d8a0c/ss_867975a8d67ff23a6800fa18b457994bff3d8a0c.600x338.jpg?t=1751553962"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/d4856d79ed